{"key":"teaching","name":"Teaching","words":[["die","Lehrerin","teacher (female)","Die Lehrerin ist sehr geduldig.","The teacher is very patient."],["der","Schüler","pupil / student (male)","Der Schüler macht seine Hausaufgaben.","The pupil is doing his homework."],["die","Schülerin","pupil / student (female)","Die Schülerin hat eine Frage.","The pupil has a question."],["der","Student","university student (male)","Der Student schreibt seine Masterarbeit.","The student is writing his master’s thesis."],["die","Klasse","class / grade","Die Klasse hat 25 Schüler.","The class has 25 pupils."],["das","Klassenzimmer","classroom","Das Klassenzimmer ist hell.","The classroom is bright."],["der","Unterricht","lessons / teaching","Der Unterricht beginnt um acht.","Lessons start at eight."],["das","Fach","school subject","Mathe ist mein Lieblingsfach.","Math is my favorite subject."],["die","Hausaufgabe","homework","Habt ihr die Hausaufgaben gemacht?","Did you do the homework?"],["die","Prüfung","exam","Die Prüfung ist nächste Woche.","The exam is next week."],["die","Note","grade / mark","Sie hat eine gute Note bekommen.","She got a good grade."],["das","Zeugnis","report card / certificate","Am Freitag gibt es Zeugnisse.","Report cards come out on Friday."],["die","Tafel","blackboard","Schreib das bitte an die Tafel.","Please write that on the board."],["das","Heft","notebook / exercise book","Schreibt das in euer Heft.","Write that in your notebooks."],["der","Stift","pen / pencil","Hast du einen Stift für mich?","Do you have a pen for me?"],["die","Übung","exercise","Macht bitte Übung drei.","Please do exercise three."],["die","Pause","break","In der Pause essen wir.","We eat during the break."],["der","Stundenplan","timetable","Der Stundenplan hängt an der Wand.","The timetable is on the wall."],["das","Semester","semester","Das Semester beginnt im Oktober.","The semester starts in October."],["die","Vorlesung","lecture","Die Vorlesung ist sehr voll.","The lecture is very full."],["das","Wörterbuch","dictionary","Benutzt ein Wörterbuch.","Use a dictionary."],["die","Grammatik","grammar","Die deutsche Grammatik ist schwer.","German grammar is hard."],["","unterrichten","to teach","Sie unterrichtet Deutsch und Englisch.","She teaches German and English."],["","erklären","to explain","Kannst du das noch einmal erklären?","Can you explain that again?"],["","üben","to practice","Wir üben jeden Tag.","We practice every day."],["","wiederholen","to repeat / to review","Bitte wiederholt die Vokabeln.","Please review the vocabulary."],["","korrigieren","to correct","Ich korrigiere die Prüfungen.","I’m correcting the exams."],["","bestehen","to pass (an exam)","Er hat die Prüfung bestanden.","He passed the exam."]]}